sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Browser
  participant Static as FastAPI StaticFiles
  participant API as FastAPI /api
  participant Loader as data_loader (startup)
  participant Panels as frontend panels

  Note over Loader: Already ran in lifespan before first request
  User->>Browser: Open http://localhost:8000
  Browser->>Static: GET / (index.html, assets)
  Static-->>Browser: HTML, CSS, JS, Chart.js

  Browser->>API: GET /api/suggested-qa
  API-->>Browser: questions from qa_bank.json
  Panels->>Browser: Render QA chips

  Browser->>API: GET /api/summary
  API-->>Browser: best summary by judge_score
  Panels->>Browser: Render executive summary

  Browser->>API: POST /api/overview (filterState)
  Browser->>API: POST /api/topics (filterState)
  Browser->>API: POST /api/entities (filterState)
  Browser->>API: POST /api/influencers (filterState)
  par Parallel dashboard load
    API-->>Browser: KPIs, crisis, donut, trend
    API-->>Browser: topics (+ unused trend payload)
    API-->>Browser: entity list
    API-->>Browser: influencer table
  end
  Panels->>Browser: Chart.js + DOM updates
